        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-29T22:12:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I understand you might feel that way right now, but honestly the villain and environment decks variety adds so much to the replayability that if you really like the game you will almost certainly want those expansions (and Shattered Timelines and Wrath of the Cosmos, where Omni and SS come from, have some of the best villains and environments they have designed). &nbsp;Either way though, all of those hero decks are worth getting however you do it</p>",
